{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "kokoro",
  "chunk_id": "kokoro-chunk-0015",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00040",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“你直接回家吗？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Are you going straight home?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00041",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“嗯，也没有什么要去的地方。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yes, there is nowhere in particular I need to go.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00042",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "两个人又默默地向南拐去，走下了斜坡。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The two of us silently turned south again and went down the slope.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00043",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“先生家族的墓地在那里吗？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Is your family grave there, Sensei?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00043",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我又开口问道。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I opened my mouth and asked again.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00044",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“不在。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No, it is not.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00045",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“谁的墓在那里？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Whose grave is there?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00045",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "——是您的亲戚？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Is it a relative of yours?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00046",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“不是。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No, it is not.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00047",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "先生不再回答什么了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Sensei gave no further answer,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00047",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我也就不再问了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and I stopped asking as well.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00047",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "走出大约一百米后，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After we had walked about a hundred meters,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00047",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "先生突然回答了我刚才的问题：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Sensei suddenly answered the question I had asked a moment before:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00048",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“那里有我一个朋友的墓。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A friend's grave is there.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00049",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“您每个月都去给朋友扫墓吗？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Do you go every month to visit your friend's grave?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00050",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“是的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00051",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "先生说完，那天我们就再也没有说话。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After Sensei said that, we did not speak again that day.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00052",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "1.塔婆：立有塔形木牌的墓地。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "1. Toba: a grave site where tower-shaped wooden tablets are set up.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
